<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT S. AFRICA BY 74 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT S. AFRICA BY 74 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat South Africa by 74 runs in their one-off one-day international cricket match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 267-6 in 50 overs; South Africa 193 all out in 46 overs).</p>
</text>
